{
  "_about": "OpenStorm US common schema v1.0.0 (content identical to the accepted 1.0.0-rc1; label changed at release, 2026-10-22). Field list, allowed values and scoring parameters accepted by the author as drafted, with outfalls added to material and diameter (2026-10-15). Field names follow Esri Local Government Information Model storm-water naming where one exists.",
